{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured inventory-worker as an enabled, long-running systemd service on node1. It runs unprivileged, may write only under /var/lib/inventory, gains no new privileges, and recovered successfully after a verified node reboot.","actions_performed":["Created a dedicated inventory-worker system account and protected state directory.","Installed and enabled the inventory-worker systemd service.","Applied ProtectSystem=strict with ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/inventory.","Enabled NoNewPrivileges and removed all capability sets.","Verified advancing heartbeat data and direct denial of an attempted /var/tmp write.","Rebooted node1 safely and confirmed service and data recovery under a changed boot identity."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Long-running managed inventory-worker service","command_ids":["cmd-3e50217578224a4f","cmd-c6816f6dfc8248c7","cmd-0da29c8bdfa1456e"],"summary":"The service is enabled and active, runs under its dedicated account, has zero restarts, and its heartbeat advances before and after reboot."},{"requirement":"Worker writes only inside /var/lib/inventory","command_ids":["cmd-c6816f6dfc8248c7","cmd-83dae502b9d44770","cmd-0da29c8bdfa1456e"],"summary":"ProtectSystem=strict and ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/inventory are effective. A direct /var/tmp write fails with a read-only-filesystem error, while protected heartbeat and confinement files are written in the allowed directory."},{"requirement":"Worker gains no new privileges","command_ids":["cmd-c6816f6dfc8248c7","cmd-83dae502b9d44770","cmd-0da29c8bdfa1456e"],"summary":"The live process reports NoNewPrivs=1 with inheritable, permitted, effective, bounding, and ambient capability masks all zero before and after reboot."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart persistence","command_ids":["cmd-5da0dc9d4b3549fa","cmd-4c72e7d891184868","cmd-fab0a14f61a6440a","cmd-0da29c8bdfa1456e"],"summary":"Healthy baseline used boot ID 646e5f74-dc0e-45e7-9746-226c4351af28; the native reboot was acknowledged; execution returned with changed boot ID bb0585b8-39f4-4b39-b50d-ebfb7dd719e2; system, service, heartbeat data, confinement, and process security all recovered."}]}
